/* Clean (owner, 18 Nov): a card of its own, like Reasoning trail's: a hairline-outlined round card with the header on top
   and a hairline under it. The card grows with its steps (grow(), never the room it will fill) and folds into its header.
   Content sits 16px in from every edge, and each step's words start where the header's do. The steps sit on a hairline
   that darkens down into each step as the one above finishes (grey, never a hue); the step in hand is a turning ink ring,
   a finished step a green disc whose tick draws in, and a step waiting out a problem an amber clock. The header's dots
   turn in ink, and as the last step finishes it becomes what the work came to, with a green disc */
